      "content": "that makes sense, focusing on the environment is probably better for a student project. but for the \"personality\" aspect, i also want to see if there are certain behavioral cues that are predictive of risk. like, i've read that in some urban areas, certain ways of communicating or specific types of social aggression are higher. could you give me some examples of survey questions that target those specific types of localized behaviors or communication styles? i want to see if they correlate with the demographic patterns we're studying.",
